  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Necessary in the sense that it harmonizes procedures and promotes economic integration. Value added in terms of capacity building and democratization. APNET is a network to promote and support national publishers with the overriding goal to supply Africa with quality litterature.</narrative>
